        "Multiple domains coupled"
      ],
      "representation": [
        "Direct text/formula",
        "Simple schematic/plot",
        "Decode topology, state or transform",
        "Multiple representations/intermediate constructions",
        "Complex linked graphical/state/symbolic representations"
      ]
    },
    "limitations": [
      "Question marks, format and text length are not score inputs.",
      "Weights and cutoffs are design choices, not fitted psychometric parameters.",
      "Question-specific cognitive steps are estimates, not measured solve times.",
      "Source corruption and low-confidence ratings are flagged.",
      "MTA tasks receive structural scores but are excluded from scored-burden summaries by default."
    ]
  },
